                <p><strong>Identifiant App Store :</strong> <a href="https://apps.apple.com/fr/app/bibleshot-un-shot-un-quiz/id6753938756" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">BibleShot - Un Shot, Un Quiz</a></p>

